      "category": "Text",
      "text": "During the month of September, the City of New York will join with industry and labor in the national \"Share-In-Freedom\" U.S. Savings Bonds campaign. Employees will be offered the opportunity to purchase the new U. S. Savings Note called \"Freedom Shares\", along with the familiar Series \"E\" Bonds, through our Payroll Savings Plan.",
