        1914,
        2043
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "To assist in the organization and conduct of the Drive within your department would you please appoint as your Executive Bond Officer a senior official personally responsible to you. Please notify Deputy Director of Finance, Julius J. Richman, whom I have designated Campaign Chairman, as soon as possible, but no later than August 18, the name of your designee. Commissioner Richman will provide Executive Bond Officers with additional details of the campaign.",
